      "statusChangeID": "66399d80063c114bc40a1220",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "I'm tentatively closing this because in a group instance, world owners are not special by design.\n\nThere are definitely things related to this we need to address, by allowing world owners to limit their world to specific groups potentially, but the priority for who has the most moderation power in an instance always goes to the owner of the instance (user, or group). Only in pure public instances are world owners the true authority.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
