      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{642b3036ffd38909cda88cd4|full_name}\n\nThanks for the clarification. I see the reasoning behind the decision now. Perhaps the core problem lies in being suddenly removed from a group instance without any prior warning or a legitimate explanation. I've faced this frustration personally, and it's truly disheartening to be unexpectedly kicked out of what you believed to be an open, public instance. Many users may not even recognize the different between group and standard public instances, which can result in undeserved dismissals and possibly discourage them from further engagement with VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
